   "title": "IDEA-104 · 3 signs your stock is out of balance",
   "original_idea": "[IDEA-104] 3 signs your stock is out of balance\nCarousel · Control\n\nObjective:\nEducation · answers Why · Light theme · Instagram + LinkedIn · when: Any time\n\nHook (EN):\n3 signs your stock is out of balance.\n\nHook (AR):\n3 علامات إنّ مخزونك مش متوازن.\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\nAnd what to do about each.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nCover OB-14; tips on BG-57.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. 3 signs your stock is out of balance.\n2. 1. One branch says \"out of stock\" while another has plenty.\n3. 2. You re-order items you already have elsewhere.\n4. 3. Transfers happen only after a customer complains.\n5. Fix: see every branch on one map, then move stock early.\n\nImages:\nOB-14\n\nCaption:\nBalancing stock between branches is the cheapest way to sell more.\nWhich sign do you recognise?",
